      "writtenOn": "2026-10-22T22:14:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looks unsafe to me as we are currently reading the tail only once in the beginning of the loop in trim(). So, primaries running trim at the exact same time can predetermine how many iterations to run and will end up trimming more than desired.",
